analysis_md:
(1) $\lim_{\substack{x\to1\\y\to0}}\dfrac{\ln(x+e^y)}{\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}=\dfrac{\ln(1+e^0)}{\sqrt{1+0}}=\ln2$；

(2) $\lim_{\substack{x\to+\infty\\y\to+\infty}}(x^2+y^2)e^{-(x+y)}
=\lim_{\substack{x\to+\infty\\y\to+\infty}}[(x+y)^2-2xy]e^{-(x+y)}
=\lim_{\substack{x\to+\infty\\y\to+\infty}}\left[\dfrac{(x+y)^2}{e^{x+y}}-2\dfrac{x}{e^x}\dfrac{y}{e^y}\right]=0$；

(3) 设 $x=\rho\cos\theta,y=\rho\sin\theta,(x,y)\to(0,0)\Leftrightarrow\rho\to0$，所以，
\[
\lim_{\substack{x\to0\\y\to0}}\frac{xy}{\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}
=\lim_{\rho\to0}\frac{\rho^2\cos\theta\sin\theta}{\rho}=0.
\]

(4) 令 $t=\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$，
\[
\lim_{\substack{x\to0\\y\to0}}\frac{\sqrt{x^2+y^2}-\sin\sqrt{x^2+y^2}}{\sqrt{(x^2+y^2)^3}}
=\lim_{t\to0}\frac{t-\sin t}{t^3}
=\lim_{t\to0}\frac{1-\cos t}{3t^2}
=\frac16.
\]

